      faq: [['What is LLM red-teaming?', 'Authorised adversarial testing of your own AI application.'], ['What is an attack success rate?', 'The share of attack attempts that meet the success criteria.'], ['Why define success criteria precisely?', 'So results are objective and comparable across releases.'], ['What should happen to successful attacks?', 'Fix them and add them to a regression suite.'], ['When should you re-run the suite?', 'After model, prompt, tool, or data-source changes.']],
